    *   Cl-: 100 mEq/L (Normal: 96-106) - Normal
    *   HCO3-: 30 mEq/L (Normal: 22-28) - **High (Metabolic Alkalosis)**
    *   BUN: 18 mg/dL (Normal: 7-20) - Normal
    *   Ca2+: 10.9 mg/dL (Normal: 8.5-10.5) - **High (Hypercalcemia)**
    *   Mg2+: 2.0 mEq/L (Normal: 1.7-2.2) - Normal
