*   **Medications:** Insulin, lisinopril, aspirin, atorvastatin.
*   **Vitals:** T 101°F (38.3°C), BP 154/94 mmHg, P 90/min, RR 17/min, SpO2 96% RA.
*   **Labs:**
    *   Na+: 140 mEq/L (Normal)
    *   Cl-: 103 mEq/L (Normal)
