3.  **Consider the differential diagnosis for altered mental status:**
    *   Infection (sepsis, meningitis, encephalitis) - Temp is only mildly elevated.
    *   Metabolic disturbances (hypoglycemia, electrolyte imbalance, uremia, hypercalcemia) - Possible, need labs.
